# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the managed workflows client package, authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform, and verify your setup."
msgstr "Pasang pakej klien aliran kerja terurus, sahkan diri kepada IBM Quantum Platform, dan sahkan persediaan anda."

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {#install}"
msgstr "Pasang {#install}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows enabled on your [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contact your administrator to enable it.\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja terurus didayakan pada [instance IBM Quantum&reg; Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) anda. Hubungi pentadbir anda untuk mendayakannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An API key and the CRN of your instance. See [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Kunci API dan CRN bagi instance anda. Lihat [Cari bukti kelayakan akses anda](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later, in an active virtual environment. See [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) for how to set up an environment.\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 atau lebih baharu, dalam persekitaran maya yang aktif. Lihat [Pasang Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) untuk cara menyediakan persekitaran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start with AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Mula pantas dengan kemahiran AI {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the AI skills in the [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) to help you install `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, package your existing local code, and deploy it as a managed workflow.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan kemahiran AI dalam [repositori templat Qiskit Function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) untuk membantu anda memasang `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, membungkus kod tempatan sedia ada anda, dan men-deploynya sebagai aliran kerja terurus.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the client package {#install-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Pasang pakej klien {#install-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the `qiskit-ibm-catalog` package:\n"
msgstr "Pasang pakej `qiskit-ibm-catalog`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command also installs `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` as dependencies. You do not need to install `qiskit-serverless` separately. The examples in these guides require `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 or later, which installs `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"
msgstr "Arahan ini turut memasang `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, dan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` sebagai dependensi. Anda tidak perlu memasang `qiskit-serverless` secara berasingan. Contoh dalam panduan ini memerlukan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 atau lebih baharu, yang memasang `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 dan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use two of these packages directly, in different places:\n"
msgstr "Anda menggunakan dua daripada pakej ini secara langsung, di tempat yang berbeza:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` is the client that you use on your local computer to upload workflows, run them, and get their results.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` ialah klien yang anda gunakan pada komputer tempatan anda untuk memuat naik aliran kerja, menjalankannya, dan mendapatkan hasilnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-serverless` runs inside your workflow code. It provides helpers such as `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, and `save_result()`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-serverless` berjalan di dalam kod aliran kerja anda. Ia menyediakan pembantu seperti `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, dan `save_result()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the client package {#update-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Kemas kini pakej klien {#update-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because managed workflows is in beta, the client package changes often. To check which version you have, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Oleh kerana aliran kerja terurus berada dalam beta, pakej klien kerap berubah. Untuk menyemak versi yang anda ada, jalankan arahan berikut:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Or, in Python:\n"
msgstr "Or, in Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update to the latest version, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengemas kini kepada versi terkini, jalankan arahan berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the new version of `qiskit-ibm-catalog` requires a newer version of `qiskit-serverless`, this command also updates `qiskit-serverless`.\n"
msgstr "Jika versi baharu `qiskit-ibm-catalog` memerlukan versi `qiskit-serverless` yang lebih baharu, arahan ini turut mengemas kini `qiskit-serverless`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate {#authenticate}"
msgstr "Sahkan diri {#authenticate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"Do not include your API key in your workflow code, in scripts, or in notebook files. A running workflow uses the credentials and instance that you used to call `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Lindungi kunci API anda\">\n"
"Jangan sertakan kunci API anda dalam kod aliran kerja, dalam skrip, atau dalam fail notebook. Aliran kerja yang sedang berjalan menggunakan bukti kelayakan dan instance yang anda gunakan untuk memanggil `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The managed workflows client uses the same credentials as `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. If you already saved an account with `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, the client loads your default saved account, and you can skip to [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"
msgstr "Klien aliran kerja terurus menggunakan bukti kelayakan yang sama seperti `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Jika anda sudah menyimpan akaun dengan `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, klien memuatkan akaun tersimpan lalai anda, dan anda boleh terus ke [Sahkan persediaan anda](#verify-your-setup).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not saved an account, save your API key and instance CRN one time in a trusted environment:\n"
msgstr "Jika anda belum menyimpan akaun, simpan kunci API dan CRN instance anda sekali sahaja dalam persekitaran yang dipercayai:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This method writes your credentials to the same file as [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). The client uses the `ibm_quantum_platform` channel by default, so you do not need to set `channel`. To save more than one account, set `name`, and pass the same `name` when you create the client.\n"
msgstr "Kaedah ini menulis bukti kelayakan anda ke fail yang sama seperti [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). Klien menggunakan saluran `ibm_quantum_platform` secara lalai, jadi anda tidak perlu menetapkan `channel`. Untuk menyimpan lebih daripada satu akaun, tetapkan `name`, dan hantar `name` yang sama apabila anda mencipta klien.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more options, such as saving several accounts or selecting an instance automatically, see [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). If you work on a public computer or another untrusted environment, do not save your credentials. Instead, follow [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
msgstr "Untuk lebih banyak pilihan, seperti menyimpan beberapa akaun atau memilih instance secara automatik, lihat [Simpan bukti kelayakan log masuk anda](/guides/save-credentials). Jika anda bekerja pada komputer awam atau persekitaran lain yang tidak dipercayai, jangan simpan bukti kelayakan anda. Sebaliknya, ikuti [Mulakan perkhidmatan dalam persekitaran yang tidak dipercayai](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify your setup {#verify-your-setup}"
msgstr "Sahkan persediaan anda {#verify-your-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect to managed workflows with your saved account, and list the workflows that you uploaded:\n"
msgstr "Sambung ke aliran kerja terurus dengan akaun tersimpan anda, dan senaraikan aliran kerja yang telah anda muat naik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not uploaded a workflow yet, the output is an empty list (`[]`). If you see an authentication error, the client did not find valid credentials. Check the account that you saved in the [Authenticate](#authenticate) section.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda belum memuat naik aliran kerja, output ialah senarai kosong (`[]`). Jika anda melihat ralat pengesahan, klien tidak menemui bukti kelayakan yang sah. Semak akaun yang anda simpan dalam bahagian [Sahkan diri](#authenticate).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) to upload a workflow, run it, and get its result.\n"
"- To start from working code, deploy one of the [Qiskit Function templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), or adapt a base template for your own workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- [Deploy aliran kerja terurus pertama anda](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) untuk memuat naik aliran kerja, menjalankannya, dan mendapatkan hasilnya.\n"
"- Untuk bermula dengan kod yang berfungsi, deploy salah satu [templat Qiskit Function](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), atau sesuaikan templat asas untuk aliran kerja anda sendiri.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
